        <mxCell id="lgNote" value="&lt;b&gt;Arrow direction&lt;/b&gt; (connectors) = the side that opens the connection. For the AMQP consumers (C15, C16) messages flow broker → consumer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Edge label&lt;/b&gt; = connector ID · protocol · target port · purpose.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ports&lt;/b&gt;: only host port 80 is published (squares on the host border); C1 and C2 share it. Every other port exists only on the internal network.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gateway routes&lt;/b&gt; C3–C8 share one line from traefik and branch to each container." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="530" y="2180" width="480" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- CONNECTOR CATALOG -->
        <mxCell id="catalog" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:4px&quot;&gt;CONNECTOR CATALOG (communication paths)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#D9D9D9;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;ID&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Source → Target (container)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Connector / protocol&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Port&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Purpose / payload&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Security&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;bololo_lobby_fe (browser) → traefik&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 over TCP: REST (JSON) + SSE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;host 80 → 80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;/menu/ page, /auth/*, /api/* (incl. /api/ratings/, /api/bots/), SSE /api/lobbies/:id/events&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;No TLS (prototype); Bearer token; SSE token in ?token=&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;bololo_game_fe (browser) → traefik&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 + WebSocket upgrade (RFC 6455)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;host 80 → 80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;/ingame/ and /chameleon/ pages, /ws/games/:gameId&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;No TLS; game JWT in ?token=&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;traefik → frontend (bololo_web_ssr)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;SSR HTML shells (/menu/, /ingame/, /chameleon/) + static assets&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Router web, priority 1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;traefik → ratings-service&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 REST (JSON)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;GET /api/ratings/leaderboard, /players/:id, /players/:id/history&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Read-only; priority 30&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;traefik → auth&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 REST (JSON)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8080&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;/auth/register, /auth/login, /auth/me, /auth/password&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;BCrypt; JWT HS256 (JWT_SECRET)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;traefik → lobby-manager&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 REST (JSON) + SSE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;/api/session, /api/lobbies..., /api/lobbies/:id/events&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Bearer session token&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;traefik → bot-service&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 REST (JSON)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8090&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;POST /api/bots/lobbies/:id/fill, GET, DELETE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Bearer session token; priority 30&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;traefik → game-logic&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;WebSocket (RFC 6455)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8081&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;/ws/games/:gameId: player actions, events and views&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Game JWT; Origin check (ALLOWED_ORIGINS)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;frontend (bololo_web_ssr) → ratings-service&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 REST (Node fetch)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;GET /api/ratings/leaderboard?mode=CLASSIC&amp;amp;limit=10, rendered into /menu/; 800 ms timeout, menu is served without ranking on failure. Direct, not through the gateway&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Public data, no token (RATINGS_URL)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;auth → lobby-manager&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 REST (Spring RestClient)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;POST /internal/auth/session (creates the player session for an account)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;X-Service-Token (SERVICE_SECRET)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C11&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;bot-service → lobby-manager&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 REST (Req) + SSE (Mint)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;/api/session, /api/lobbies/:id, join, leave, /events (direct, not through the gateway)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Session token per bot&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C12&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;bot-service → game-logic&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;WebSocket (mint_web_socket)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8081&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;/ws/games/:gameId, same protocol as the browser; CLASSIC and CHAMELEON&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Game JWT&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C13&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;lobby-manager → game-logic&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;HTTP/1.1 REST (httpx)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8081&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;POST /internal/games {gameId, lobbyId, mode, players}, GET /internal/games/:id&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;X-Service-Token&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C14&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;game-logic → rabbitmq&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;AMQP 0-9-1 over TCP (amqp091-go 1.16.0)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5672&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Publish game.ended {gameId, lobbyId, mode, winners, endReason, standings, finishedAt} to bololo.events; publisher confirms + mandatory, 6 attempts (1–16 s backoff)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;RABBITMQ_USER / RABBITMQ_PASSWORD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C15&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;lobby-manager → rabbitmq&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;AMQP 0-9-1 over TCP (aio-pika)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5672&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Consume lobby.game-ended, prefetch 1, ack after commit (idempotent by gameId), unrecordable messages to lobby.game-ended.dead&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;RABBITMQ_USER / RABBITMQ_PASSWORD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C16&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;ratings-service → rabbitmq&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;AMQP 0-9-1 over TCP (aio-pika)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5672&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Consume ratings.game-finished, prefetch 1, ack after commit, dead letters to bololo.events.dead&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;RABBITMQ_USER / RABBITMQ_PASSWORD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C17&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;ratings-service → ratings-postgres&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;SQL driver: PostgreSQL protocol v3 (asyncpg)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5432&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;ratings, processed_games, rating_changes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;DB user bololo_ratings&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C18&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;auth → auth-postgres&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;JDBC driver (PostgreSQL protocol v3)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5432&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;accounts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;DB user bololo_auth&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C19&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;lobby-manager → postgres&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;SQL driver: PostgreSQL protocol v3 (asyncpg)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5432&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;players, lobbies, lobby_players, game_results&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;DB user bololo&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;C20&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;game-logic → redis&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Redis driver: RESP3 over TCP (go-redis v9)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6379&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Match snapshots bololo:game:{id}, games:active&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;requirepass (REDIS_PASSWORD)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#FFF2CC&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;D1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;lobby-manager → rabbitmq&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;AMQP 0-9-1 over TCP (aio-pika)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5672&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Publish game.finished to bololo.events from an outbox (every 2 s, publisher confirms + mandatory), after recording game.ended. Not in the C&amp;amp;C view, which only draws C15 between lobby and broker&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;RABBITMQ_USER / RABBITMQ_PASSWORD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#FFF2CC&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;D2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;traefik → Docker Engine&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Docker Engine API, HTTP over Unix socket&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;docker.sock&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Reads container labels to build the routes (infrastructure connector)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Bind mount read-only&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=8;overflow=fill;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1050" y="1870" width="2630" height="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
